5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I worry about who sits beside whom. It shapes our whole week.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"We should decide who gets the worse spots, not let habit decide.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I am worried about the cost. The budget is tight.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mio,,My mornings are already busy. I need to know the time cost.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Comfort matters. I sit here all day. It needs to be right.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Toshio, yes. We need to be fair about the seating.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Shizue, agreed. We must be explicit about the trade-offs.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Mio, the time cost is real. But so is the money.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Daisuke, true. But if it takes ten minutes, that is lost work.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"I just want a quiet, comfortable spot. That is all.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,Let us look at the data. It will help us decide.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will check the past shuffles. They were messy.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I need to see the billing basis. It is confusing.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Mio,,I will check the morning routine upstairs. It might be a model.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I will look at the sound levels. Noise is a big issue.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I will check the survey. It shows what people want.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I will also check the badge records. Arrival times matter.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I will check the facilities quote. I need the numbers.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Mio,,I will check the joiners' reports. They might have insights.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
