35,2,1,talk,Shizue,,The survey says daylight is key. The joiners learned by listening.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,Shuffles took two weeks. Badge times show early and late arrivals.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"We pay for empty desks. Moving costs 6,200 yen per desk.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Mio,,Upstairs takes 4-9 minutes to set up. Joiners learned by overhearing.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,It is 9 decibels louder by the printer. Chairs take days to adjust.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, if we move, we lose that listening time?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Daisuke, 6,200 yen is a lot. We should minimize moves.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Toshio, yes. And we pay for empty space. We need to fill it.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Shizue, maybe. But if we are close, we can still talk.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Daisuke, if we move, my chair setup is ruined.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Shizue,,We need a layout that keeps us close but fair.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Toshio,,Fixed desks might be best. No more shuffles.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,Fixed desks mean no more moving costs. That saves money.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Mio,,"But if we are fixed, do we lose the casual chats?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,Fixed desks let me keep my setup. That is good for me.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Shizue,,I like the idea of fixed desks. It feels stable.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Toshio,,I agree. It avoids the chaos of shuffles.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I support it. It is the most cost-effective.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Mio,,I am hesitant. I like the flexibility.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,I am for it. Comfort is important.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
